rsh criticism”. ","Use {{value}} (0–29) on beech — harsh criticism as a starting observation: describe a concrete situation and its impact on the day. ","Your {{value}} (0–29) on beech — harsh criticism is at the highest possible response value. ","Your {{value}} (0–29) on centaury — difficulty setting boundaries is at the lowest possible response value. ","Practice one small and respectful no when you are already overloaded; notice the outcome without judging yourself.","\\"Centaury — Difficulty setting boundaries\\"","Centaury — Difficulty setting boundaries: {{value}} (0–29). ","Weighted matches concern the emotional theme “Difficulty setting boundaries”. ","Use {{value}} (0–29) on centaury — difficulty setting boundaries as a starting observation: describe a concrete situation and its impact on the day. ","Your {{value}} (0–29) on centaury — difficulty setting boundaries is at the highest possible response value. ","Your {{value}} (0–29) on cerato — doubting personal judgment is at the lowest possible response value. ","Write your first independent choice before asking for reassurance; compare it with what you choose afterward.","\\"Cerato — Doubting personal judgment\\"","Cerato — Doubting personal judgment: {{value}} (0–29). ","Weighted matches concern the emotional theme “Doubting personal judgment”. ","Use {{value}} (0–29) on cerato — doubting personal judgment as a starting observation: describe a concrete situation and its impact on the day. ","Your {{value}} (0–29) on cerato — doubting personal judgment is at the highest possible response value. ","\\"bach.cherry_plum\\"","Your {{value}} (0–29) on cherry plum — fear of losing emotional control is at the lowest possible response value. ","Notice early signs of rising tension and arrange a short pause before you become overwhelmed.","\\"Cherry Plum — Fear of losing emotional control\\"","Cherry Plum — Fear of losing emotional control: {{value}} (0–29). ","Weighted matches concern the emotional theme “Fear o